name: Experimental settings can be opened and left through visible keys
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/govulncheck_curation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/govulncheck_curation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART catalog
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: use govulncheck
require-live-snap: 20 Enter settings | support-selected
expect: Experimental
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 OPTIONS | settings-opened
expect: Experimental
expect: Esc tools
keys: C-g
type: keys
require-live-snap: 20 COMMAND PALETTE | options-command-palette
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 20 VIEW · Options | option-keymap
expect: option
expect: Enter
expect: edit
expect: details
expect: standard/advanced/missing
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 OPTIONS | options-after-keymap
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 20 view:logs | theme-origin-logs
submit: theme
require-live-snap: 20 reads system pref | theme-reader
type: held theme command draft
require-live-snap: 20 held theme command draft | theme-held-draft
expect: Esc close
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 view:logs | theme-restored-origin
expect: held theme command draft
ask: Do Options list the real selection and edit keys, and does Escape from Theme return to Logs with the composer draft intact?
keys: C-u
submit: use govulncheck
require-live-snap: 20 Enter settings | support-after-theme
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Esc tools | settings-after-theme
keys: Enter C-u
type: Operator α draft path
require-live-snap: 20 Operator α draft path | field-draft
expect: Esc keeps draft
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Value: not set | kept-field-draft
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Enter settings | returned-selection
expect: govulncheck:scan
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 20 Enter settings | support-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 20 Enter settings | support-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 Enter settings | support-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 20 Enter settings | support-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Enter settings | support-40x12
expect: Experimental
keys: Down Up Enter
require-live-snap: 20 OPTIONS | settings-40x12
expect: Esc tools
ask: Are selection, Enter settings and Escape back visible and usable at every size, without starting work?
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Operator α draft path | reopened-draft
expect: Esc keeps draft
keys: Escape Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Enter settings | restored-origin
keys: Escape
type: typed command draft
require-live-snap: 20 typed command draft | composer-owner
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/govulncheck_curation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does field cancellation preserve its draft while Escape from support gives typing back to the composer and keeps source unchanged?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | draft-exit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: use govulncheck
require-live-snap: 20 Enter settings | recovered-support
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 OPTIONS | recovered-settings
expect: Experimental
expect: Esc tools
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/govulncheck_curation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does no-color restart keep the supported browsing contract without dispatching work or treating an unsaved field as persisted?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
